  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) The study provides a benchmark and review of machine learning methods that predict in silico spatially resolved gene expression from H&E histopathology images; general reviews had surveyed and categorised these methods without benchmarking, so this work provides systematic benchmarking and systematic review context through evaluation categories and evaluation metrics for spatial and biological characteristics of predicted genes; the cited methods' performance had not yet been comprehensively benchmarked; robustness is represented by the article's stated lack of comprehensive understanding of performance, stability and broader applicability of individual methods; the work assesses limitations and generalisability of translational potential; in the clinical applicability context, H&E images are routinely used in clinical practice and SGE prediction from H&E has potential clinical usage and potential clinical translation.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
